    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, upgrade, repeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Running Out</i> is a fast-paced platformer where every second counts. Time is limited, but each run brings you closer to victory. Progress, upgrade your abilities, and optimize every move to go further and further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An addictive challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a race against the clock. Your first attempts will be short\u2014very short\u2014but every run unlocks upgrades that push your limits. More speed? Higher jumps? A dash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every choice shapes your progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure adrenaline</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight and responsive platforming mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive gameplay loop based on constant improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenge that rewards reflexes and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, readable style perfect for high-speed action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go before time runs out? \u23f3\ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, upgrade, repeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Running Out</i> is a fast-paced platformer where every second counts. Time is limited, but each run brings you closer to victory. Progress, upgrade your abilities, and optimize every move to go further and further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An addictive challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a race against the clock. Your first attempts will be short\u2014very short\u2014but every run unlocks upgrades that push your limits. More speed? Higher jumps? A dash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every choice shapes your progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure adrenaline</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight and responsive platforming mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive gameplay loop based on constant improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenge that rewards reflexes and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean, readable style perfect for high-speed action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go before time runs out? \u23f3\ud83d\udd25</p>",
